## API Quick Reference

### NavigationStack

```swift
NavigationStack { content }
NavigationStack(path: $path) { content }
```

### NavigationSplitView

```swift
NavigationSplitView { sidebar } detail: { detail }
NavigationSplitView { sidebar } content: { content } detail: { detail }
